The local HTTP serving structure, thread-safe TTL cache and source launchers
are adapted from upstream. Original upstream code remains under
src/claude_usage_dashboard for provenance, but is not used or packaged by the
new application. Codex ingestion, deduplication, timezone analytics, pricing,
Chinese UI, exports, settings and tests are new custom implementations.

